# This repo is the crypto docs home (HARD)

Write all new crypto documentation in this repository **in the same turn
as the work**. Do not send the author to grok-trading-desk, SKYNET-SOL,
or skynet-astra `docs/` folders to add a new long-form page.

Parents are desk books. Children are engines or workers. Everything you
do for an engine stays on that engine page (see `how-to-write.mdx`).

New engine / book / radio lane → new child page under the right parent,
registered in `docs.json`.

Add MDX, register it in `docs.json`, push `main`. The repo is public:
no secrets, tokens, host IPs, or env values.

Live enter/skip/hold calls are not documentation.
